Package: robinsonlabwebsite
Title: Robinson Lab Website
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Not an R package. This file lists the R packages needed to render
    the website (only publications.qmd runs R code). The GitHub Actions build
    installs them from here; locally, run pak::local_install_deps() or
    remotes::install_deps().
